     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">Dear all,</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">With a slight delay we would like your New\r\nYear 2016 to go with passion, energy and wonderful wildlife studies.</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">We are glad to remind you of the<span> </span><b>33<sup>rd</sup> IUGB Congress and\r\n14<sup>th</sup> Perdix Congress</b><span> </span>which\r\nwill take place in<span> <u></u><u></u></span><b>Montpellier,\r\nSouth of <u></u><u></u>France<u></u><u></u>,\r\nfrom August 22nd to August 25th 2017</b>.</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">The website is now open, still under\r\nconstruction, but you can already register to the newsletter to be informed\r\nabout this congress. You can find the website here:</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://iugb2017.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://iugb2017.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495163046000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Lq310Gr0F1MAwd0SYEPR8\">http://iugb2017.com/</a> , and the information flyer in\r\nattached file.<u></u><u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">If you want to get\r\ninvolved in the Congress organisation or in its financing, you can contact us\r\nat:<span> </span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">iugb...@gmail.com</a>.</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">Thank you for circulating this information\r\nwidely to your entire network in order to make this event a scientific success!</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">If you need any further information, feel\r\nfree to contact us.</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\">Best regards,</span><u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"2\"><u></u><u></u>\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"><font size=\"2\">The Organizing Committee: Murielle\r\nGuinot-Ghestem, IUGB President, Sophie Verzelloni, Matthieu Guillemain,\r\nLaetitia Pouiol, Elisabeth Bro, ONCFS (The National Wildlife and Hunting\r\nAgency), Yves Lecocq, past President of IUGB.</font></span><u></u><u></u></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:black\"><font size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></div>"
